      936   PROCEDURE adm-delete-record :
      937    MESSAGE
      938          "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
      939            "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Delete.":U
      940              VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
